WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,960
Follow team rules

2
00:00:01,280 --> 00:00:14,370
You need to hand over one-third of the gasoline to you

3
00:00:14,610 --> 00:00:16,650
Now I don’t owe you anything but me.

4
00:00:17,210 --> 00:00:18,210
When did you owe me

5
00:00:18,530 --> 00:00:19,850
I forgot about that piece of bread last time

6
00:00:20,130 --> 00:00:22,650
Your brother Huang Mao never takes advantage of his brothers.

7
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:32,980
I'm going to let the team stay here. Do you think it's okay? I'll take a look.

8
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:41,660
Many ghosts and murderers lurk at night

9
00:00:41,660 --> 00:00:42,620
They will all come out for activities

10
00:00:43,160 --> 00:00:44,520
It's really not a good time to rush now

11
00:00:45,580 --> 00:00:46,580
Just rest here

12
00:00:46,820 --> 00:00:47,740
Departure at dawn

13
00:00:48,140 --> 00:00:49,420
OK, listen to you
